{"name":"Incident with Actions","status":"resolved","created_at":"2026-02-02T19:03:14.218Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T20:36:45.117Z","monitoring_at":null,"resolved_at":"2026-02-03T00:56:04.931Z","impact":"major","shortlink":"https://stspg.io/q03plj7gcr4d","scheduled_for":null,"scheduled_until":null,"scheduled_remind_prior":false,"scheduled_reminded_at":null,"impact_override":"major","scheduled_auto_in_progress":false,"scheduled_auto_completed":false,"metadata":{},"started_at":"2026-02-02T19:03:14.210Z","reminder_intervals":null,"id":"xwn6hjps36ty","page_id":"kctbh9vrtdwd","incident_updates":[{"status":"resolved","body":"On February 2, 2026, between 18:35 UTC and 22:15 UTC, GitHub Actions hosted runners were unavailable, with service degraded until full recovery at 23:10 UTC for standard runners and at February 3, 2026 00:30 UTC for larger runners. During this time, Actions jobs queued and timed out while waiting to acquire a hosted runner. Other GitHub features that leverage this compute infrastructure were similarly impacted, including Copilot Coding Agent, Copilot Code Review, CodeQL, Dependabot, GitHub Enterprise Importer, and Pages. All regions and runner types were impacted. Self-hosted runners on other providers were not impacted. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis outage was caused by a backend storage access policy change in our underlying compute provider that blocked access to critical VM metadata, causing all VM create, delete, reimage, and other operations to fail. More information is available at https://azure.status.microsoft/en-us/status/history/?trackingId=FNJ8-VQZ. This was mitigated by rolling back the policy change, which started at 22:15 UTC.  As VMs came back online, our runners worked through the backlog of requests that hadn’t timed out. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWe are working with our compute provider to improve our incident response and engagement time, improve early detection before they impact our customers, and ensure safe rollout should similar changes occur in the future. We recognize this was a significant outage to our users that rely on GitHub’s workloads and apologize for the impact this had.","created_at":"2026-02-03T00:56:04.931Z","wants_twitter_update":false,"twitter_updated_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-02-03T20:36:45.112Z","display_at":"2026-02-03T00:56:04.931Z","deliver_notifications":true,"tweet_id":null,"id":"n8781m1fml08","incident_id":"xwn6hjps36ty","custom_tweet":null,"affected_components":[{"code":"vg70hn9s2tyj","name":"Pages","old_status":"operational","new_status":"operational"},{"code":"br0l2tvcx85d","name":"Actions","old_status":"operational","new_status":"operational"},{"code":"pjmpxvq2cmr2","name":"Copilot","old_status":"operational","new_status":"operational"}]},{"status":"investigating","body":"Actions is operating normally.","created_at":"2026-02-03T00:56:00.567Z","wants_twitter_update":false,"twitter_updated_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-02-03T00:56:00.567Z","display_at":"2026-02-03T00:56:00.567Z","deliver_notifications":true,"tweet_id":null,"id":"7c4vqqxnfck3","incident_id":"xwn6hjps36ty","custom_tweet":null,"affected_components":[{"code":"vg70hn9s2tyj","name":"Pages","old_status":"operational","new_status":"operational"},{"code":"br0l2tvcx85d","name":"Actions","old_status":"partial_outage","new_status":"operational"},{"code":"pjmpxvq2cmr2","name":"Copilot","old_status":"operational","new_status":"operational"}]},{"status":"investigating","body":"Based on our telemetry, most customers should see full recovery from failing GitHub Actions jobs on hosted runners.\u003cbr /\u003eWe are monitoring closely to confirm complete recovery.\u003cbr /\u003eOther GitHub features that rely on GitHub Actions (for example, Copilot Coding Agent and Dependabot) should also see recovery.","created_at":"2026-02-02T23:50:15.475Z","wants_twitter_update":false,"twitter_updated_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-02-02T23:50:15.475Z","display_at":"2026-02-02T23:50:15.475Z","deliver_notifications":t